"weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226902812", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032632811", "personaname": "CasualCheetah", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/casualcheetah/", "num_games_owned": 1070, "num_reviews": 954, "playtime_forever": 3099, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2926, "last_played": 1785559942, "avatar": "06a8f7f92c5ec7bec891eb00cf0a9c28fdd7e9cc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Palworld is a beautiful clusterfuff of a game that blatantly lifts countless mechanics, tropes, and stylizations from mainly an unmentionable lawsuit-happy company, and I'll be damned if it all doesn't somehow work. It's a comedically brutal and amusingly realistic take on creature collecting merged with a number-go-up automation and survival game. Co-op is good fun as it lets you effectively tackle this multifaceted game as you diversify your crew and take turns exploring, building, and maintaining your ethically questionable ranch. Setting new goals and pursuing them is addictively rewarding when there are so many avenues to engage with. With 1.0 on the horizon, I’d give it a bit, but do really keep an eye on Palworld. It’s a genuine hoot with friends and the most entertaining, charmingly scuffed, and morally uncomfortable adorable animal unpaid labor simulator to grace the gaming landscape.", "timestamp_created": 1780265813, "timestamp_updated": 1780265813, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 31, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "226902518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069274036", "personaname": "Evol", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198069274036/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 1681, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 452, "last_played": 1780867616, "avatar": "1f1084cf346110d167672c7807c5c70d85753e63"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is amazing for survival and building so far. Progression for main story/base building, as well as side quests you find by exploring new villages, etc. There are bad guys ya gotta deal with as well as bosses. Crafting up the yin-yang. You can go melee, or different guns/shotguns, etc, or bow/arrow, etc. Companions up the booty... Enough said: Buy the game!", "timestamp_created": 1780265504, "timestamp_updated": 1780265504, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226900965", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070298188", "personaname": "Danialno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070298188/", "num_games_owned": 50, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 11364, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 622, "last_played": 1786918794, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "amazing game!", "timestamp_created": 1780263896, "timestamp_updated": 1780263896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}]}